{
  "about": "SYNTHETIC triage vignettes and threshold probes for the safety evaluation (docs/25). Written on 2026-11-13 from the criteria text in docs/10 §2 and the cited sources, BEFORE running the engine on them, and not edited afterwards to make a result pass. Same author as the rules engine's documentation: this checks that the engine does what its cited criteria say (conformance), not that the criteria are clinically right for a patient. Not clinician-labelled. No real patient data.",
